<title>DENMARK: Danish NKT soars on cable contract.</title>
<headline>Danish NKT soars on cable contract.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cable-maker NKT Holding A/S climbed over six percent on Wednesday after announcing that it had won a contract to lay undersea power lines between Norway and the Netherlands, worth up to two billion crowns over four years.</p>
<p>At 1025 GMT the share traded at 376 crowns, compared to an opening 360 and Tuesday's closing 353 crowns.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
